OL,3,GNEWSA'Our unfinished estate is like
OL,4,Ano-man's land'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents on two estates have hit out
OL,7,Fat the developer for leaving roads and
OL,8,Fpaths unfinished, 15 years after the
OL,9,Ffirst homes were built.
OL,11,FIn all some 350 homes are on the Thomas
OL,12,FBeddoes and Scarlett Oaks estates in
OL,13,FShifnal, Shropshire - both built by
OL,14,FTaylor Wimpey.
OL,16,FHowever, residents said some areas were
OL,17,Fstill unsurfaced or in bad repair and
OL,18,Fmost roads still lacked white lines,
OL,19,Feven at junctions or mini roundabouts,
OL,20,Fwhich they said had safety
OL,21,Fimplications.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
