OL,3,GNEWSA'Our unfinished estate is like
OL,4,Ano-man's land'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Taylor Wimpey said
OL,7,Fthe firm was "committed to resolving
OL,8,Fthe outstanding matters" and are
OL,9,F"carrying out the necessary inspections
OL,10,Fand remedial works".
